{"4603610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Frozen Cabin", "steam_appid": 4603610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4786720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short psychological horror experience set deep in a frozen wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded during a storm, you take shelter in an isolated cabin hidden within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange noises echo through the night. Objects move when you're not looking. The deeper you explore, the more the cabin reveals something it shouldn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Psychological horror focused on tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration-based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A short but intense experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things only move when you stop looking at them... and they get closer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short psychological horror experience set deep in a frozen wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded during a storm, you take shelter in an isolated cabin hidden within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange noises echo through the night. Objects move when you're not looking. The deeper you explore, the more the cabin reveals something it shouldn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par